part Flange
param outer = 120
param bore = 50
param thick = 16
param bolt = 10

sketch ring on XY
  circle outerCircle 0 0 outer/2
  circle boreCircle 0 0 bore/2
end

extrude body from ring depth thick join
hole bolt1 on face:body:top at 45 0 diameter bolt through
pattern_circular bolts source bolt1 axis Z count 6 angle 360
